[TITLE]
SIM-04: leak expansion in SI units. One 100 m pipe from R1 to J1 at 30 m of
pressure head. Its only leakage parameter is an expansion rate of 1.

[JUNCTIONS]
;ID   Elev  Demand
 J1   0     0

[RESERVOIRS]
;ID   Head
 R1   30

[PIPES]
;ID  N1  N2  Length  Diam  Rough  Mloss  Status
 P1  R1  J1  100     300   100    0      Open

[LEAKAGE]
;Pipe  Area  Expansion
 P1     0     1          ; 1 sq mm per m of head, per 100 m of pipe

[TIMES]
 Duration  0

[OPTIONS]
 Units     LPS
 Headloss  H-W

[END]
